  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Quiet Study Desk",
    "overview": "yoteach is a calm desk for lecture materials, with a living glass companion beside it. Premium restraint comes from pale translucent surfaces, a stable reading rail, compact system typography, and small iris accents. Lavender and icy blue belong to the glass and Yoyo; the student’s course names, notes, and source documents remain the visual priority.\n\nThe material stays consistent across light and dark themes: bright frosted glass becomes deep blue glass, with brighter lavender foregrounds and restrained borders. Yoyo supplies warmth through an original pear-shaped SVG and gentle motion. The mascot remains visually separable from the workspace and replaceable without changing companion behavior.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Readable liquid glass with thin edges and diffuse depth.",
      "One system font family, compact controls, and clear title-to-detail hierarchy.",
      "Persistent desktop navigation with spacious study surfaces.",
      "Iris selection states, quiet course color families, and a lavender-to-icy-blue mascot.",
      "Honest empty states, local activity, and explicitly labelled future features."
    ],
    "rules": [
